        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Offset 8 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Offset 8 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pull has a very modern, rectangular shape. This door handle has an overall length of 9 inches and 8-1/8 inch mounting centers and is ready to install. Choose from wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass door installation. It will come packaged with the necessary mounting hardware to accommodate your door thickness . Just select your door thickness from 1/4 inch all the way up to 3 inches thick. The 8 Inch Offset Square Door Pull has a beautiful and easy to care for brushed stainless steel finish. For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/offset-12-inch-brushed-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>12 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/offset-24-inch-brushed-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>24 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/offset-36-inch-brushed-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>36 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Doorware Designs RTOPULL8-630:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 9\" (205mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/8\" (178mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1\" (25mm) x 1/2\" (13mm)</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 2-5/16\" (60mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with removable rectangular rosettes.</li>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTOPULL8-specification.pdf?v=1704262423\"><b>DWD-RTOPULL8 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</p> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "8 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "The Offset 8 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pull has a very modern, rectangular shape. This door handle is ready to install. Choose from wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass door installation. It will come packaged with the necessary mounting hardware to accommodate your door thickness ranging from 1/4 inch all the way up to 3 inches thick. The 8 Inch Offset Square Door Pull has a beautiful and easy to care for brushed stainless steel finish. For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. \r\n",
                "keywords": "8 Inch Offset Square Door Pulls, Offset 9 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pulls, DWD-RTOPULL8-630, modern door pulls, contemporary door pulls, brushed stainless steel door pulls, satin stainless steel door pulls, door pulls for store doors. Commercial door pulls, store door door pulls, Door pulls with 8 inch center to centers, Offset 9 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Handles, Doorware designs RTOPULL8,"
